From d4ef61235116996739ba5136d6936ef5af460b81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 08:38:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add French and Arabic translations to the admin CMS
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The admin panel's own interface (nav, buttons, forms, toasts, order
statuses, dashboard) was English-only, unlike the customer-facing site
which already supports fr/en/ar. Mirrors that same data-i18n / t() /
translations pattern:

- admin.js: state.lang + localStorage persistence, t(key, vars),
  applyTranslations(), setLanguage(), and a full en/fr/ar dictionary
  (181 keys) covering every static and dynamically-rendered string
  (orders, menu items, categories, dashboard/stats, all modals, toasts,
  confirm() dialogs).
- index.html: data-i18n / data-i18n-title / data-i18n-aria attributes
  on static markup, plus a compact FR/EN/AR language switcher on both
  the login screen and the app header.
- admin.css: loads Noto Kufi Arabic (same font already used on the
  customer site) and swaps to it via --font-body when dir="rtl". No
  other RTL-specific overrides were needed — the existing CSS already
  uses logical properties (margin-inline-*, text-align:end, etc.)
  throughout, so layout mirrors automatically.

Defaults to English (opt-in) so existing staff see no change unless
they pick a different language.
---
 public/admin/admin.css  |  29 +-
 public/admin/admin.js   | 960 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 public/admin/index.html | 158 +++----
 3 files changed, 922 insertions(+), 225 deletions(-)

diff --git a/public/admin/admin.css b/public/admin/admin.css
index d3f826f..c5324cd 100644
--- a/public/admin/admin.css
+++ b/public/admin/admin.css
@@ -23,18 +23,24 @@ html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
   --radius-md:12px;
   --shadow-1: 0 1px 2px rgba(20,18,14,.06);
   --shadow-2: 0 12px 28px rgba(20,18,14,.14);
+  --font-latin: 'Inter', system-ui, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
+  --font-arabic: 'Noto Kufi Arabic', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
+  --font-body: var(--font-latin);
 }
+/* Swapped to the Arabic-optimized stack whenever admin.js sets dir="rtl"
+   (Arabic UI selected) — same mechanism as the public site's i18n. */
+html[dir="rtl"]{ --font-body: var(--font-arabic); }
 
 body{
   background: var(--bg);
   color: var(--text);
-  font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
+  font-family: var(--font-body);
   line-height:1.4;
   min-height:100vh;
 }
-h1,h2,h3 { margin:0; }
-button { font-family:inherit; }
-input, select, textarea { font-family:inherit; font-size:.92rem; }
+h1,h2,h3 { margin:0; font-family:var(--font-body); }
+button { font-family:var(--font-body); }
+input, select, textarea { font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:.92rem; }
 
 :focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--ember); outline-offset:2px; }
 
@@ -150,6 +156,21 @@ input, select, textarea { font-family:inherit; font-size:.92rem; }
 .admin-user .btn-ghost{ color:#fff; border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.25); }
 .admin-user .btn-ghost:hover{ border-color:var(--ember); color:var(--ember); }
 
+/* ---------- LANGUAGE SWITCHER (FR / EN / AR) ---------- */
+.lang-switcher{ display:flex; gap:2px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius:var(--radius-sm); padding:2px; flex-shrink:0; }
+.lang-btn{
+  background:transparent; border:none; color:rgba(255,255,255,.65); font-weight:800; font-size:.72rem;
+  padding:5px 9px; border-radius:6px; cursor:pointer; letter-spacing:.02em;
+}
+.lang-btn:hover{ color:#fff; }
+.lang-btn.is-active{ background:var(--ember); color:var(--text-on-ember); }
+/* Login card has a light background — the header's dark-on-dark styling
+   above would be invisible there, so it gets its own light-surface variant. */
+.login-card .lang-switcher{ align-self:flex-end; background:var(--surface-alt); margin-bottom:-4px; }
+.login-card .lang-btn{ color:var(--text-muted); }
+.login-card .lang-btn:hover{ color:var(--text); }
+.login-card .lang-btn.is-active{ background:var(--primary); color:var(--text-on-ember); }
+
 .admin-main{ max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; padding:28px 20px 60px; }
 .admin-view .view-toolbar{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; margin-bottom:18px; }
 .admin-view h2{ font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:800; }
